# Hermes profile environment — read by MadeEA OS for Jarvis's voice.
#
# NOTE: install/3 says this file lives at ~/.hermes/profiles/main/.env.
# On this machine HERMES_HOME is %LOCALAPPDATA%\hermes, so the real path is
# the one you are reading now. The app resolves it via hermesHome() +
# profiles/<active_profile>/.env, so this is where it actually looks.
#
# ── Jarvis speaking voice (install/3, Part B) ──────────────────────────────
# Sign up free at https://elevenlabs.io, copy your API key, and uncomment:
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_key_here
#
# Optional — a specific voice. ElevenLabs → Voices → click one → copy Voice ID.
# Without this it uses the default British voice.
# AGENTIC_OS_TTS_VOICE=your_voice_id
#
# Restart the dashboard after adding a key:
#   cd "MadeEA OS/source" && PORT=3737 npm start
